From cb438ebb165578bc1b8c4eca36cb485c7f1c137c Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: ggbdpq <ggbdpq@gmail.com>
Date: Sat, 17 Oct 2026 03:51:34 +0800
Subject: [PATCH] gateway: an assistant turn cut off before it said anything is
 left out of what a Chat upstream is sent (#2599)
MIME-Version: 1.0
Content-Type: text/plain; charset=UTF-8
Content-Transfer-Encoding: 8bit

What changed
- A turn the agent interrupted before it produced text or tool calls —
  thinking only, an empty text, nothing — stayed in the agent's history
  and went to Chat upstreams with "content": "" (reasoning_content alone
  included), which DeepSeek, Kimi and the like turn away with "content
  or tool_calls must be set" on every later turn of the conversation.
  The translated build now leaves such a turn out and joins the user
  messages around it into one (toolAsUser's way); a Resume's prefill
  turn and a reply to a tool result stay, where the strict template
  wants them.
- A relayed Chat request gets the same pass (emptyAssistantTurnsOut,
  next to developerAsSystem): empty assistant turns are dropped and the
  user messages around them join; a turn that answers a tool result
  stays; a turn with real content or calls is untouched.

Run
- New TestChatEmptyAssistantLeftOutFromAnthropic (six cut-off shapes:
  thinking, empty text, thinking+text, no blocks, sealed only, empty
  string, against a fake upstream that refuses as DeepSeek does),
  TestChatEmptyAssistantLeftOutFromResponses (isolated reasoning item),
  TestChatRelayLeavesOutEmptyAssistant (relayed and translated, two
  upstreams), TestChatThinkingOnlyAssistantLeftOutOutsideExchange,
  TestChatEmptyAssistantBetweenCallsAndUserDropped,
  TestChatResumeEmptyPrefillKept: red with both product files back at
  the parent 25dc5013, green with the fix — the sent request is one
  user message "hi\n\ncontinue" where main sent user, assistant(""), user.
- go test -tags nogui -p 2 -count=1 -run 'TestChatEmptyAssistant|
  TestChatThinkingOnlyAssistant|TestChatRelayLeavesOut|TestChatResume|
  TestChatSessionShape|TestChatTool' ./internal/gateway/: ok.
  gofmt -l internal/gateway/: clean. go vet -tags nogui darwin / linux /
  windows: clean. go build darwin / linux nogui / windows: ok, with the
  known trayimage cgo warning and ld duplicate-library warnings.

